gs like that broad  um  my son who's four is having the time of  his life he's doing a couple costume  changes and spider-man and power rangers  so  i think seeing him light up like this is  really special everything you guys  mentioned by the way is on the  convention floor listen i have a million  other questions and they are already  giving me the hook i am just going to  say i really really cannot wait to watch  the rest of it i hope it's a massive hit  and you guys get to keep going and i  just want to say thank you for coming in  thank you so much thank you

